@startuml AgentPay System Context
!theme plain
title AgentPay — System Context

actor "API seller" as Seller
actor "Approver" as Approver
actor "Agent / buyer" as Buyer
rectangle "AgentPay\nSeller-side agent commerce gateway" as AgentPay
rectangle "Seller API" as SellerAPI
cloud "x402 facilitator\n(testnet)" as Facilitator
cloud "AWS Bedrock" as Bedrock

Seller --> AgentPay : Configures paid routes\nreviews transactions/disputes
Buyer --> AgentPay : Discovers offers\ncreates intent\npays for request
Approver --> AgentPay : Reviews and approves/vetoes
AgentPay --> SellerAPI : Forwards one signed request
AgentPay --> Facilitator : Verifies/settles testnet payment
AgentPay --> Bedrock : Requests structured proposal/explanation
Bedrock --> AgentPay : Tool calls only\n(no wallet access)
@enduml

